The legislative texts in this repository are from ARLIS, the legal information system of the Republic of Armenia
(https://www.arlis.am). Under article 4(1)(c) of the Law of the Republic of Armenia on Copyright and Related Rights
(ՀՕ-142-Ն, 15 June 2006), official documents (legal acts, treaties and their official translations) are not objects
of copyright. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording.

